The Get Clássica is a card machine for individuals (CPF) or businesses (CNPJ) who want to sell more without paying rental [1]. Its 2025 product page lists:
- a free account and card, and receipt in 2 days [1];
- a single rate across the main card brands: debit 1.69%, credit 1x 3.79%, 2x 7.98%, 3x 8.47%, 4x 8.96% and 5x 9.45% [1];
- a free machine depending on sales, which that page sets at R$10 thousand per month for the Get Mini or Get Clássica [1].

That page is from 2025 and may be outdated. The newer 2026 general page says the Get Clássica is free above R$20 thousand per month and lists receipt in 2 business days [6]. Voucher (VA/VR) and Crediário sales don't count toward the rental waiver [1][6]. The page title also describes it as a "POS 3G + Wi-Fi" machine [1]. The sources don't give the Get Clássica's credit rates from 6x onward or its technical specifications.

MISSING: Get Clássica credit rates from 6x to 12x and technical specifications
